			<div class="content" id="post-content-1914607">
									

<p>New SCP. This came about for a couple of reasons - the pun, and the frustration I feel at people with whose sentiments I agree but whose methods seem counterproductive (e.g. I remember a group of protesters who managed to get a politician out of his car and looking at their petition by being reasonable and polite, but then someone at the back started hurling abuse and threw something - so of course the politician left and denounced the people for their violence. The petition was ignored).</p>
<p>Thanks to:</p>
<p>- Roget<br />
- Dmatix<br />
- Cerxi (who supplied the image)<br />
- Sciurus<br />
- tahunu<br />
- Randomini</p>
<p>who provided criticism which helped me refine this.</p>

