<p>This is indeed a good piece. Not too short and not too long, with just enough information to close me out satisfied. That it's an Anart piece that has nothing to do with AWCY is also something I like.</p>
<p>One thing I do wonder about though&#8230; Since this SCP-1854-2 is basically an infohazard triggered by SCP-1854-1, I'm dubious as to whether or not there's a good reason in-universe to include Addendum 1854-B in the document. This is going to be given to all personnel who are assigned to work on the object. So&#8230; after having read this document, none of those people can ever, <em>ever</em> look at the painting they're containing. Having seen the painting itself, one can never <em>ever</em> read this SCP document in its entirety.</p>
